<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN CATALA SWINGS TO H1 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN CATALA SWINGS TO H1 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		17.15   vs   0.460 loss</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales (bln)    1.303  vs   1.367</p>
<p>    Cash flow			114.68   vs  96.32</p>
<p>NOTE - Papeteries Catala SA is a Belgian paper maker.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company warned second half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>could be hit by new tensions in the paper market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
